      "description": "Temp Staff NE Admin - Las Cruces, New Mexico, United States Temp Staff NE Admin - Las Cruces, New Mexico, United States Kiosk mode Temp Staff NE Admin 504172 Las Cruces, New Mexico, United States Temporary Staff Temporary Staff Closing at: Jan 11 2027 - 23:55 MST Department Contact: NMSU Human Resources, teamhrs@nmsu.edu, 575-646-8000 Internal or External Search: External - Open to all applicants Advertising Summary: Temporary Pool for Administrative Assistant. This is a temporary appointment with a pre-determined end date not to exceed 1 year and is subject to an earlier termination if necessary. Temporary employees have no entitlement or expectation of continued employment during or beyond the appointment period. Position may average up to 29 hours per week. Position Details Position Title: Temp Staff NE Admin College/Division: Administration and Finance Department: 510038-EMPLOYMENT & COMPENSATION SVCS Location: Las Cruces Offsite Location (if applicable): Target Hourly/Salary Rate: Varies by Department. Appointment Full-time Equivalency: 0.74 FLSA Status : Non-Exempt Bargaining Unit Announcement: This is NOT a bargaining unit position with American Federation of State, County & Municipal Employees (AFSCME). Contingent Upon Funding: Contingent upon funding Standard Work Schedule: Standard (M-F, 8-5) If Not a Standard Work Schedule: Job Duties and Responsibilities: Varies by Department Qualifications Required Education and Experience: Required Education: High School diploma or GED certificate.; Required Experience: No previous work experience required.; Equivalency: None; Required Equivalent Qualifications: None Preferred Qualifications: Special Certification/Licensure: Working Conditions and Physical Effort Environment: Work is normally performed in a typical interior/office work environment. Physical Effort: Light physical effort. Effort applies to no more than two (2) hours per day. Lifting Requirements: Requires handling of average-weight