tes 330500-COMPUTER SCIENCE New Mexico State University invites applications for two tenure-track Assistant Professor positions in Applied AI (9-month appointments). Faculty will join an interdisciplinary cluster hire and be affiliated with the new Institute for Applied Practice in AI and Machine Learning. Instructor, Early Childhood 2800 Sonoma Ranch Boulevard, Doña Ana Community College, New Mexico, United States, 88011 940831-DACC EARLY CHILDHOOD EDUCATION DACC, a responsive, accessible, comprehensive, learning-centered community college that provides education opportunities to a diverse community of learners is inviting candidates to apply for the following vacant position: Nursing Clinical Instructor 2800 Sonoma Ranch Boulevard, Doña Ana Community College, New Mexico, United States, 88011 940735-DACC NURSING ASSOCIATE DEG PGM DACC, a responsive, accessible, comprehensive, learning-centered community college that provides education opportunities to a diverse community of learners is inviting candidates to apply for the following vacant position: College Assistant Professor Las Cruces, New Mexico, United States 330450-COMMUNICATION STUDIES The Department of Communication Studies at New Mexico State University seeks a College Assistant Professor. Apply Now First Name (required) a66c2902 Last Name (required) cfd89e1a Email (required) d6febdde Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations, and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept Please choose the location(s)"
